<gpx version="1.1" creator="RuteStrip fix_loop_routes" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
  <metadata>
    <name>Gunung Arjuno via Tambak Watu</name>
    <desc>Gunung Arjuno via Tambak Watu: one-way trailhead -&gt; Puncak Ogal Agil from the ORIGINAL recording (RuteStrip research collection), no added geometry. all 6 track parts joined in file order (gaps between parts 0, 0, 14, 0, 0 m); already one-way trailhead -&gt; summit. Evidence: 74% of points within 60 m of OSM Purwosari trail (relation 'Gunung Arjuno (Purwosari BC)'); Tambak Watu is the Purwosari basecamp, the first ~2.6 km below the OSM way are the basecamp approach; kept track on OSM relation 'Gunung Arjuno (Purwosari BC)' (74%), way 'Jalur Pendakian Gunung Arjuno via Purwosari' (70%); OSM node 'Tambaksari' is 2.20 km from the kept trailhead. OSM data (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL 1.0.</desc>
    <link href="https://rutestrip.ai.id/routes/25-gunung-arjuno-via-tambak-watu"><text>original source</text></link>
  </metadata>
